WEBVTT

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:09.460
Keitaro?

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.450
Keitaro!

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.680
This little girl's mother
will be working for us.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:17.990
You'll play with her. Won't you?

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:19.940
Huh? Sure...

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.010
It's Liddo-kun!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.770
Now. You be nice
to her too, Naru-chan.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:32.400
e C'mon. Let's go now! e

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.550
e C'mon. Let's go now! e

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:38.470
e Let's all go off
on a big adventure! e

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.350
e Today we tough it out! e

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.280
e Today we tough it out! e

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.230
e Today we tough it out
on the wide open seas! e

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.330
Did you know that if two people
who love each other go to Tokyo U.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.130
They say they'll live
happily ever after!

00:00:59.030 --> 00:00:59.710
Tokyo U?

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:01.860
Tokyo U?

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:03.930
Tokyo U?

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.240
I guess we all dozed off...

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:30.560
I just had the strangest...

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.770
C'mon. We gotta hit the books.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.470
I'm Urashima Keitaro,

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:42.620
an applicant to Tokyo U,
 studying away after three failures.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.620
My dream is to get into Tokyo U.

