00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:04.580
Love Hina Christmas Special

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:04.590
Silent Eve

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:27.190
e The angels of love have
descended to Earth... e

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:31.260
e ...and cast a spell of the
century's end on us. e

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:34.720
e On this hallowed winter's night.
If you profess your love. e

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:42.290
e And it'll surely be granted
on this holy night. e

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.720
e You can hear the carols echo
through the twinkling town. e

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:01.580
e It's just like those
movies I used to love. e

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:06.920
e My heart beats with
excitement. But why is it? e

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.590
Yeah. I heard that rumor too.

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:12.410
"Profess your love this Christmas Eve. And
any wish you have will come true." huh?

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.690
Hocus pocus like that
is so unscientific.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.640
But those are just lyrics
in a song. Aren't they?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:21.240
Well. I heard the rumor came first.
And then they made it into a song.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.270
I wonder if that
could really happen...

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:24.960
It'd be nice. Though. Wouldn't it?

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:29.460
Huh?! Akiko-chan, don't tell me you
 have someone you want to profess to!

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.110
Don't you, Shinobu?

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:31.730
Huh?!

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:34.920
Well...

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.160
There's no one!

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.290
December 21st

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.630
Hey. Christmas is just
around the corner, isn't it?

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:18.870
May I borrow your eraser?

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.310
Oh. Sure. Here.

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:25.350
Oh. Dear.

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:26.310
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.010
Catch!

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.190
To my right, Narusegawa.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.120
To my left, Mutsumi-san.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.440
Man, this is torture...

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:42.260
Isn't Narusegawa worried
about me and Mutsumi-san?

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:46.920
Hey. I heard something
from Kitsune-san!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.900
She says there's this rumor going
around that if you profess your love...

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:51.980
...on Christmas Eve this year.
Any wish you have will come true!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.980
Fight!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.980
Practice Exam

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.980
Tough

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.980
it

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.980
