00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:55.810
Keitaro-kun. You need to make your dream
of getting into Tokyo U come true.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:00.760
Yeah. And?

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.890
Hey. Check it out!
It's for the Christmas party!

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.520
Yeah. I just can't wait!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.380
Look. Iook!

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:14.670
Sorry. But we're studying now.
Could you please leave?

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:17.900
Narusegawa...!

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:23.100
Uh... Oh. You're right!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.330
We're really sorry.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:28.730
C'mon. You two. Let's go!

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:30.350
We're really sorry.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:33.650
What's with her,
actin' all scary...

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.930
C'mon. Now!
Decorate it right!

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.660
Kitsune-san. If you'd stop drinking
for a while. Maybe you could...

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.800
Oh. Don't pay me no mind.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.870
Oh! You two going out?

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.430
Where's Naru?

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:53.080
She's still studying by herself.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:57.680
Normally, she'd get all upset about
you two going out on a date

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.890
It's not a date!

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.530
I have things to take
care of in town too. That's all.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:07.130
I guess I should
do some shopping...

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.680
West Hinata Station

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:15.870
Why did you want to
come along with me?

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:18.810
No reason. It's just that I ran out of booze.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.330
I only have enough
for notebooks. Okay?

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:22.620
Sure. Sure...

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:32.250
Let's go another way. Okay?

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:35.610
What, you still can't
stand Christmas?

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.410
I'm just not in the
mood to be cheerful.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.340
This "Profession on Christmas Eve"
stuff is a bunch of nonsense.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:44.550
In real life, most people
spend it in front of the TV.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:48.430
Well, I gotta admit that I'm one of those people...

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:51.520
Cakes

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:51.520
Now Taking Reservations!!

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:52.070
If you place a reservation right now.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.260
We can have it ready for
you on Christmas Eve!

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:54.980
On Christmas Eve!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.580
The town's decked out
in Christmas colors...

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:02.070
...and all the couples walking by
are full of happiness.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:04.770
But here we are. Stuck working
part time until Christmas Eve.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.190
Like we have a choice. We're poor as dirt.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:08.180
But!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:09.080
What?

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.830
But with a friend like you.
Who's even poorer than us...

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:13.100
...and destined to fail his exams
for a fourth time...

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:14.610
I feel kinda happy!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.150
That makes you happy?!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.460
Hey. You working part time
for the cake shop, Keitaro?

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:20.630
Someone sure has confidence...

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:26.150
Narusegawa... Well. It's just that
I really needed to get some cash.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.570
Naruse... gawa...

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:29.910
Oops.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.020
That's pretty cold.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:34.110
Seems like she's given up on you.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.810
You get that feeling too?

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.780
Darn that Naru... What's she thinking?

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:46.280
December 22nd

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:48.800
Apartment Manager:
 Urashima Keitaro

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.540
Told ya they'd be here!

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:51.990
Look at the pile of presents!

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.700
This must be for me!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.980
Huh? What's this?

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.680
This is mine? Talk about lame!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.170
Okay. Let's hit the next spot!

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:05.630
Naru Narusegawa

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:06.890
Nothing...

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:12.910
There's a letter with it!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.200
Who's it to? The loser?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:16.270
Probably...

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:17.400
love

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:17.440
love

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:17.480
love

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:17.520
love

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:17.560
love

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:17.610
love

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:17.650
love

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:17.690
love

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:17.730
love

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:17.770
love

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:17.810
love

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:17.860
love

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.520
love

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.480
R-Really?!

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:23.540
Did it really have l-l-lo...

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.260
Have "love" written in it?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.680
I couldn't read all of it. But I saw that much.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:31.490
Naru must be planning to profess
her love on Christmas Eve!

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:34.320
Let's keep this
from Keitaro. All right?

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:38.910
If he learned of this. He'd become
too excited to study. No doubt.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:40.050
But...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:49.520
Thank you for the meal.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.580
Uh. N-Narusegawa...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.970
Um... About Christmas Eve...

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:02.030
Thanks again for breakfast.
I have to start studying right away.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:05.310
Narusegawa...

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:25.020
Senpai, are you all right? Your studies...

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:28.750
I wonder what the heck Narusegawa is thinking?

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:32.650
She doesn't even say anything about
me being with Mutsumi-san anymore...

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:37.560
I thought we were really connecting.
But I guess it was only me.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:41.280
Getting wrapped up in thoughts
like that is getting me...

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.070
Oh. I'm sorry.

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.030
I'm sorry. Making you listen
to me gripe like that...

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:47.280
No. That's not it.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:54.080
If you think like that, it would be terrible
for both you and Narusegawa-senpai!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:56.230
It would be terrible...

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.870
It would?
Shinobu-chan, is there something?

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:03.290
Would you please help, Kitsune-san?

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.210
Oh. Don't pay me no mind.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.950
So that's it! That's what
you were up to, Narusegawa!

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:19.100
You can be so cute sometimes!

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:19.810
What the hell?!

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:20.990
Twirly. Twirly!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:21.930
BE QUIET!

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.850
I'm so sorry. I couldn't hide it
from him any longer...

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.000
No. Its not your fault, Shinobu.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:31.860
But that moron will ruin his chances for the exam if he keeps this up and breaks a leg or something.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:37.150
I see!
 She'll profess her love
to me on Christmas Eve!

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:40.710
But just waiting around for her
wouldn't be manly!

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.950
All right! Then I'll go ahead and...

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:42.950
Hey!

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.540
What are you doing
way up there?

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:46.520
Up where?

00:11:58.710 --> 00:11:59.510
A sprained ankle?

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:00.980
That's so cool!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:01.170
Let's go see!

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.290
There's no need
to agitate him further.

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.860
How'd this happen?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:12.810
Narusegawa.

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:14.810
Geez...

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.810
What were you thinking.
Goofing around at a time like this?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.960
Keep still. You'll make it worse.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:22.860
Okay...

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:26.690
Of all the stupid...
Are you serious about the exams?

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:29.910
I couldn't help it.
I was really happy.

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:33.180
Happy about what?

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:37.430
Well... Um. You know...

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.680
<i>Huh? What's going on?</i>

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:37.410
<i>What's with that look?</i>

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.550
<i>Wasn't she going to tell me she loves me?</i>

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.660
It's nothing...

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:40.900
<i>I get it!</i>

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.230
<i>My spraining my ankle
was the last straw...</i>

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.740
<i>You're not sure if you can love
a miserable man like me...</i>

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.510
<i>Is that right, Narusegawa?</i>

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:50.790
With any luck. It'll be a little better
in time for the practice exam.

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:53.050
Bye.

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.080
<i>"'Bye"? What's that
supposed to mean?</i>

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.120
<i>You're going away, Narusegawa?</i>

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.070
<i>Does that mean you've
given up on me?</i>

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.730
<i>Wait, wait a second, Narusegawa...</i>

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:07.000
I've got to speak up...
Right, I've got to take the initiative!

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:08.580
Narusegawa. I love you!

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:19.930
Narusegawa...

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:26.980
December 23rd

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:32.020
Looking for Naru?
She left this morning.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:35.580
Aw. The presents are gone too!

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:38.070
What's going on, Narusegawa?

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.030
You're a total idiot!

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.230
Who goes around. Blurting out
professions of love like that?!

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.670
Just looking at your
face makes me sick!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.530
Is that really
what she's thinking?

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:51.770
Well... That's one possibility.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:54.590
It's not every day that she takes off
without telling anyone.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.790
But to think you finally said it...

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:04.520
Narusegawa

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:28.960
Packing up and heading home
right before the practice exams...

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.270
My professing my love
must've bugged her.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:34.640
So she...

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:37.670
That shouldn't bend that way!

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:43.130
Do you think Naru-senpai has
 given up on professing her love?

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:44.320
Hard to say.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:47.090
Either way. They'll see each other at
the practice exam on Christmas Eve.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.570
Naru could return the sentiment.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:50.970
Or Keitaro might end up
making an idiot of himself...

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.980
Either way. It's time to
break out the popcorn!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.220
That's so mean...

