00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:13.060
December 24th

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.190
Today is Christmas Eve...

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:25.780
Well. Then...

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:28.790
We'll be on our way now.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:33.000
Seems like he's got more important things
to worry about than the practice exam...

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:37.540
Sasaki Prep School

