00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:42.380
First Exam Room

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:44.470
First Exam Room

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:51.540
Narusegawa!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.740
Uh. Um...

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.170
L-Let's do our best. 'kay?

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:13.120
Sasaki Prep School

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:14.870
Aren't they done yet?!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:16.070
Hold your horses...

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.130
Hey! Here they come!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:21.130
Huh? Where. Where?

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:31.560
She's not with Urashima-senpai?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.630
Wait. She still has her present.
So it's possible...

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.810
...that they made plans to meet
each other somewhere else.

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:38.870
All right. Time for
some hot pursuit!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.800
Hot pursuit. Hot pursuit!

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.120
Shouldn't we let them be?

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:49.300
What's up. Motoko? You have
some other plans for today?

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:50.290
No...

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:51.540
Then let's go!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:52.910
Oh. For the...

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:58.830
Huh? Where's Narusegawa?

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:00.720
Narusegawa...

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.940
Looks like she's headin' for Tokyo.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.140
Tokyo?

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:16.420
It's not that frightening a place.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:18.410
It's no different from Hinata Hot Springs.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.350
N-No different at all.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.900
It sure is a strange place.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:30.270
Hey. There's Naru!

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:36.890
Whoa. That's an ultra deluxe hotel!

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:40.210
You guys picked this
for a secret rendezvous?

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:42.500
You're going too far. Naru, Keitaro!

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:50.620
Senpai...

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:57.790
Come on. Now!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:03.790
Hey!

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:05.650
There she is!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:06.580
She's done it...

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:09.460
Our little Naru's finally
given him her present!

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:11.460
The one with that letter
about her being in love!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:15.830
Way to go. Keita... ro?

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.370
Huh? You guys?

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:22.170
Daddy! Why?!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:25.170
If that's Seta, then where
the heck is Keitaro?

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:26.510
Keitaro!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:29.020
Keitaro...!

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:31.090
Why?

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:35.720
Wait. Keitaro!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.460
Seta! What's this all about?!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:41.150
Hey. Don't rough up
my daddy!

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.340
W-What's all this about, Kitsune-san?

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.530
Oh. Is this part
of a Christmas party?

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:59.590
Shinobu-chan said that the present had a letter
with a message about being in love...

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.260
And that present
went to Seta-san...

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.530
And this is a special Christmas Eve...

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:10.590
So, Narusegawa was
still in love with Seta-san...

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.400
Which means my professing my love
for her really was just a nuisance,

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.670
and that's why
she was avoiding me.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:37.840
Keitaro!

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:44.220
Shinobu... Today is Christmas Eve.
So do you want to go someplace?

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:45.750
Senpai...

00:20:58.010 --> 00:20:59.480
Oh my! Naru-san!

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.860
Are you all done
professing your love?

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:06.930
What is this? Why is everyone
chasing us around?!

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:11.190
Aren't you going to profess to Keitaro.
Today being Christmas Eve and all?

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:11.810
No. I won't!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:17.020
Oh. You're not going to?
In that case, I just might!

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.640
Huh? Mutsumi-san? But that's...

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.940
Oh. It there something wrong?

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:24.720
No. It's not wrong
or anything. But...

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:29.590
But you weren't the girl Keitaro
made his promise to, right?

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:32.450
Yes, Naru-san.
Just like you weren't either.

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:38.930
What the hell is this
supposed to mean?

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:42.550
I don't quite
understand any of this.

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:45.140
I wonder what Naru-chan
wanted to tell me?

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.190
You're as dense as they come!

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.390
Time to go. Su, Sara!

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:51.750
Talk to you later. Daddy!

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:54.610
It's nice how they're
all so full of energy...

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.240
Chances are they won't head
back to Hinata Apartments.

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:03.850
Go check all the places
they're likely to go!

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.290
Roger!

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:08.930
But I don't have any money!

00:22:16.470 --> 00:22:19.260
Damn it, why can't
he wait until tonight?

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:20.370
That idiot.

00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:25.030
Motoko-chan? You came too?

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:27.500
Senpai, you forgot this.

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:29.940
What? But this isn't mine.

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:35.610
Urashima

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:35.610
To Narusegawa

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:35.230
This is Keitaro's... For me...

00:22:36.170 --> 00:22:36.850
Oh. Is that so?

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:39.030
Thank you for riding.

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:39.310
Then please return it to its owner.

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:40.260
Now arriving at Shibuya.

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:41.050
Why me?

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:42.630
You give it back to Motoko-chan!

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:49.280
Shibuya. This is Shibuya. Thank you for riding.

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:52.400
In any case. Please get
that to Urashima!

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:54.340
The doors are about to close.

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:07.120
This is...

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:13.640
It's so cute!

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:20.810
What's the matter?

00:23:22.090 --> 00:23:24.640
This is why he was
working part time...

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:29.780
Keitaro...

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:40.530
Groper!

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:45.470
How awful!

00:24:07.100 --> 00:24:09.870
I know. Let's ride the Ferris Wheel next!

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:11.450
C'mon. Shinobu-chan!

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:14.130
Uh. Um. Senpai...

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:15.330
Yeah?

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:17.330
What's wrong, Shinobu-chan?

00:24:17.780 --> 00:24:18.520
Are you hungry?

00:24:18.980 --> 00:24:19.560
No.

00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:24.490
What is it then? Oh, I see.
I'm just a bore to be with. Right?

00:24:25.800 --> 00:24:27.910
No. No! It's wonderful!

00:24:28.550 --> 00:24:30.410
I know I shouldn't
be enjoying myself like this.

00:24:31.000 --> 00:24:33.180
But I'm having so much
fun being with you.

00:24:33.790 --> 00:24:36.030
I want this to last forever...

00:24:38.310 --> 00:24:38.770
Huh?

00:24:39.760 --> 00:24:42.260
That's all the money I got!
You gotta cut me some slack!

00:24:42.710 --> 00:24:43.240
Thanks!

00:24:46.920 --> 00:24:48.450
Yes. If you could. Please...

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:51.120
If he calls, tell him
to meet me there.

00:24:51.870 --> 00:24:52.380
Thank you.

00:25:00.520 --> 00:25:02.170
Did Naru-chan sound all right?

00:25:02.730 --> 00:25:05.100
Sounds like she
isn't upset anymore.

00:25:05.600 --> 00:25:09.350
Thank goodness... Then why did
she come home over this?

00:25:10.730 --> 00:25:12.890
I guess that's how
much it means to her.

00:25:14.600 --> 00:25:16.310
She wanted to be alone
and think things over.

00:25:17.490 --> 00:25:19.400
Because he means
the world to her.

00:25:29.050 --> 00:25:30.730
What kind of money is that?

00:25:31.610 --> 00:25:34.600
The people at Hinata Hot Springs
didn't mind taking this money!

00:25:35.310 --> 00:25:38.930
This is our busiest time of year.
Don't tease an old man like this.

00:25:43.960 --> 00:25:45.910
Sure is harsh around here...

00:25:48.880 --> 00:25:52.510
Why should I read that?
What good would it do now?

00:25:53.110 --> 00:25:53.990
Senpai...

00:25:55.240 --> 00:25:56.100
I don't want to!

00:26:05.150 --> 00:26:09.020
"Seta-san, thank you for all you've
done for me over the years."

00:26:09.630 --> 00:26:13.010
"Today I have something very
important that I must profess to you."

00:26:13.040 --> 00:26:14.540
Stop it, Shinobu-chan.

00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:21.110
"Seta-san, ever since I was in high school."

00:26:22.690 --> 00:26:23.280
"I had loved you."

00:26:24.620 --> 00:26:28.390
"But I now believe that those feelings
were childish adoration."

00:26:29.520 --> 00:26:31.690
"I was so desperate to
be loved by others..."

00:26:32.380 --> 00:26:35.600
"...that I was content to have
someone be kind to me."

