00:26:41.060 --> 00:26:43.920
"I have now come to realize
that being loved..."

00:26:45.120 --> 00:26:49.050
"...is not as important
as loving another."

00:26:50.950 --> 00:26:53.010
"And so, I am now in..."

00:26:55.270 --> 00:26:56.030
Do you get it now?

00:26:57.390 --> 00:27:01.090
Senpai... You only have
until midnight today.

00:27:02.740 --> 00:27:04.870
Christmas Eve this year... is special.

00:27:06.160 --> 00:27:07.300
So you have to hurry.

00:27:14.230 --> 00:27:16.750
Kitsune-san... I'm a terrible girl.

00:27:17.610 --> 00:27:18.350
You're a good kid.

00:27:18.890 --> 00:27:20.630
C'mon. Let's head home
to Hinata Apartments.

00:27:21.240 --> 00:27:22.640
I blew all my money
on that taxi.

00:27:23.330 --> 00:27:24.350
Lend me train fare. Okay?

00:27:24.870 --> 00:27:25.780
Of course...

00:27:26.900 --> 00:27:27.230
Huh?

00:27:29.570 --> 00:27:30.430
Huh? What?!

00:27:31.500 --> 00:27:32.210
What's the matter?

00:27:32.750 --> 00:27:35.730
I... I think I dropped
my wallet somewhere.

00:27:38.810 --> 00:27:41.870
But I just blew my last yen!

00:27:43.480 --> 00:27:45.170
The pedestrian bridge
at Omotesandou?

00:27:45.820 --> 00:27:49.660
That's quite a romantic spot.
Don't you dare make her wait.

00:27:50.810 --> 00:27:51.790
Thank you!

00:27:55.180 --> 00:27:56.560
I still have plenty of time!

00:28:12.150 --> 00:28:12.810
Her present...!

00:28:14.460 --> 00:28:16.020
I guess I can go pick it up later.

00:28:17.850 --> 00:28:18.660
His present...!

00:28:28.380 --> 00:28:29.530
Pretty lady!

00:28:33.020 --> 00:28:34.320
Oh. I'm terribly sorry!

00:28:34.580 --> 00:28:35.540
No, it's all right...

00:28:38.920 --> 00:28:43.400
Oh. What did I do?
What the hell did I do?!

00:29:03.030 --> 00:29:05.480
Watch out, world... Here I come!

00:29:22.020 --> 00:29:23.140
Shibuya this time?!

00:29:23.690 --> 00:29:28.610
Yeah, she called again to say she was running late and wants you to wait for her at Shibuya Station.

00:29:29.910 --> 00:29:34.450
What's this about?
Is she just messing with me?

00:29:36.480 --> 00:29:40.650
She said she'd get there while
 it's still Christmas Eve. She promised.

00:29:42.120 --> 00:29:43.260
You've got to trust her!

00:29:47.970 --> 00:29:50.700
Shibuya... That's not
far from here, I think.

00:30:05.920 --> 00:30:07.010
It'll be a White Christmas!

00:30:07.290 --> 00:30:08.480
Ready for karaoke?

00:30:08.970 --> 00:30:09.620
Sure. Why not?

00:30:13.320 --> 00:30:17.190
The man may have been a groper.
But you still shouldn't have injured him.

00:30:18.280 --> 00:30:19.450
Why did you do such a thing?

00:30:20.640 --> 00:30:24.310
He's right... Why did I do such a thing?

00:30:30.650 --> 00:30:33.980
What happens between the two
of them is none of my concern.

00:30:38.000 --> 00:30:41.560
As far as I'm concerned,
today is a day like any other.

00:30:42.760 --> 00:30:44.430
There is nothing special about it.

00:30:45.110 --> 00:30:47.980
For me, today is the
same as tomorrow.

00:30:51.290 --> 00:30:53.550
Geez. Where are Naru and Keitaro?

00:30:53.990 --> 00:30:55.270
Hey. What're we gonna do?

00:30:58.190 --> 00:31:01.790
This is the worst Christmas ever!
Let's just go home!

00:31:03.880 --> 00:31:06.970
But if we skip out now,
It'll stay the worst Christmas ever.

00:31:08.640 --> 00:31:10.820
I wanna make it a happy one!

00:31:18.300 --> 00:31:22.230
If this was Hinata Hot Springs, we
could borrow money from somebody.

00:31:22.910 --> 00:31:25.180
But I don't see a single
friendly face here.

00:31:28.670 --> 00:31:29.680
I want to go home...

00:31:31.810 --> 00:31:32.350
Shinobu...

00:31:33.820 --> 00:31:37.370
Shinobu, were you planning
to profess your love to Keitaro today?

00:31:43.250 --> 00:31:43.970
I see...

00:31:44.720 --> 00:31:46.630
But don't worry, Shinobu.

00:31:47.090 --> 00:31:49.210
Even if they say today is a special day,
It doesn't mean that everybody...

00:31:50.140 --> 00:31:52.610
...gets to profess their love
and live happily ever after.

00:31:54.940 --> 00:31:55.670
Heck, look at me.

00:31:57.100 --> 00:31:58.380
It's pretty lonely...

00:31:58.890 --> 00:32:00.840
But that's the point... Right?

00:32:01.630 --> 00:32:04.600
That's why we keep butting in,
'cause we wanna watch 'em get...

00:32:05.370 --> 00:32:07.480
...all the happiness they can.
No matter how little.

00:32:10.840 --> 00:32:11.340
Shinobu-chan?

00:32:13.610 --> 00:32:15.380
What are you doing here?

00:32:17.090 --> 00:32:18.820
Akamatsu-sensei!

00:32:24.040 --> 00:32:26.910
Here you are!
Thank you very much!

00:32:27.740 --> 00:32:30.960
Here you are!
Thank you very much!

00:32:30.950 --> 00:32:33.120
Boy, you're a real lifesaver.

00:32:33.130 --> 00:32:35.790
If you help me sell my books, I'll make
sure you're compensated for your trouble.

00:32:36.310 --> 00:32:38.370
All right then. We'll be able
to make it home now!

00:32:39.680 --> 00:32:41.800
Thank you so much!

00:32:42.590 --> 00:32:45.930
What I'm saying is,
 The Yamanote Line goes around in a circle.

00:32:46.390 --> 00:32:49.000
So it'll be hard to find any
lost items before tomorrow.

00:32:46.390 --> 00:32:49.020
Harajuku. This is Harajuku.

00:32:49.380 --> 00:32:51.010
But it has to be today!

00:32:50.580 --> 00:32:52.440
Thank you for riding.

00:32:56.660 --> 00:32:59.650
The doors are about to close. Please be careful.

00:33:21.980 --> 00:33:24.290
You're nuts! You want to
catch up with a train?

00:33:24.770 --> 00:33:25.140
Please!

00:33:27.050 --> 00:33:28.760
Is it that important?

00:34:09.030 --> 00:34:11.200
Be more careful from
now on. All right?

00:34:24.420 --> 00:34:25.660
All alone...

00:34:26.590 --> 00:34:27.410
Motoko-sama?

00:34:28.790 --> 00:34:29.700
Motoko-sama!

00:34:30.150 --> 00:34:31.480
Motoko-senpai!

00:34:30.150 --> 00:34:31.480
Motoko-senpai!

00:34:31.460 --> 00:34:32.440
Is something the matter?

00:34:33.150 --> 00:34:33.900
What are you...

00:34:34.270 --> 00:34:37.870
We were on our way to have
an all night Christmas party.

00:34:38.330 --> 00:34:40.920
It's in Shibuya!
Won't you please join us?

00:34:41.250 --> 00:34:42.460
Please! Please come with us!

00:34:42.670 --> 00:34:44.900
Please, Motoko-senpai! Please come along!

00:34:43.860 --> 00:34:45.510
Please come along!

00:34:46.740 --> 00:34:49.700
Well... given the day, I suppose it's appropriate.

00:34:50.970 --> 00:34:52.220
All right!

00:35:09.790 --> 00:35:11.250
Wha? Mutsumi-san?!

00:35:13.380 --> 00:35:17.570
You needed to dry out your clothes.
So I chose this place.

00:35:18.100 --> 00:35:20.340
This place sure seems
like fun. Doesn't it?

00:35:51.870 --> 00:35:54.190
You sure this is okay?
We don't have any money!

00:35:54.680 --> 00:35:58.010
I have a daughter myself.
She's living alone right now.

00:35:58.740 --> 00:36:01.980
I couldn't bear the thought her
being in the same situation as you two.

00:36:02.840 --> 00:36:04.800
Maehara Yasuharu

00:36:07.770 --> 00:36:09.070
This is gonna take forever...

00:36:09.620 --> 00:36:10.430
Oh. No!

00:36:17.600 --> 00:36:20.960
You mustn't... your clothes are still wet.

00:36:22.030 --> 00:36:23.010
You'll catch cold!

00:36:23.410 --> 00:36:26.230
Uh. Um. Well. You see...

00:36:28.040 --> 00:36:29.980
I made a promise
with Narusegawa!

00:36:31.730 --> 00:36:32.630
A promise?

00:36:37.390 --> 00:36:39.730
Mutsumi-san... I'm really sorry.

00:36:40.450 --> 00:36:44.270
I know I made a promise
to you when I was a kid.

00:36:44.790 --> 00:36:48.940
But now, I'm trying to get into
Tokyo U so that I can be with...

00:36:50.210 --> 00:36:53.220
I... I have a confession to make.

00:36:53.620 --> 00:36:54.250
Mutsumi-san...

00:36:54.810 --> 00:36:58.260
When I was small, I lived
at Hinata Apartments.

00:36:58.760 --> 00:37:00.940
And there was this boy I really liked.
And I heard him say...

00:37:01.400 --> 00:37:04.590
"You can live happily ever after
if you can get into Tokyo University."

00:37:05.040 --> 00:37:05.550
So...

00:37:06.390 --> 00:37:11.370
Huh? But I thought the girl
I made my promise to said that...

00:37:12.030 --> 00:37:13.560
That wasn't me.

00:37:14.130 --> 00:37:17.790
I was only there when you were
 talking about it afterwards, Kei-kun.

00:37:18.370 --> 00:37:21.360
I... I'm not the girl you
made your promise with.

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:22.400
What?

00:37:23.390 --> 00:37:26.300
But I still like you very much
to this very day, Kei-kun.

00:37:27.150 --> 00:37:29.050
That's why I want you
to be happy.

00:37:34.670 --> 00:37:37.380
You'll never be able to find
someone in Shibuya. Not today.

00:37:38.210 --> 00:37:39.630
Just reach him
by phone somehow...

00:37:39.970 --> 00:37:40.870
There's no time!

00:37:45.560 --> 00:37:47.520
Shibuya Station

00:37:59.110 --> 00:37:59.730
Naruse...

00:38:00.900 --> 00:38:01.640
My mistake.

00:38:03.270 --> 00:38:03.770
N-Naru...

00:38:08.130 --> 00:38:09.290
I'm sorry!

00:38:09.160 --> 00:38:13.760
e I've been carefully warming... e 

00:38:14.710 --> 00:38:19.010
e ...this oh so small scrap of happiness. e 

00:38:16.820 --> 00:38:18.590
Wow. Iook at all the people!

00:38:19.120 --> 00:38:24.270
e When I think about it. e 

00:38:24.650 --> 00:38:29.230
e It hurts so much deep down inside. e 

00:38:27.800 --> 00:38:28.610
Mutsumi-san...

00:38:29.260 --> 00:38:32.440
Have you seen Keitaro-kun and Naru-san?

00:38:30.040 --> 00:38:34.880
e Your eyes. Your voice... e 

00:38:34.900 --> 00:38:36.240
Narusegawa!

00:38:35.990 --> 00:38:41.330
e I hold all these things oh so dear. e 

00:38:42.540 --> 00:38:48.260
e As the powdery snow touches my cheeks. e 

00:38:48.590 --> 00:38:54.290
e It turned into tears. e 

00:38:49.940 --> 00:38:50.690
Urashima!

00:38:53.080 --> 00:38:54.590
Narusegawa-san!

00:38:55.300 --> 00:38:59.010
e Please be with me forever. e 

00:38:57.050 --> 00:38:58.520
Narusegawa!

00:38:59.350 --> 00:39:03.730
e And never let go of my hand. e 

00:39:04.100 --> 00:39:06.730
e In the winter sky. e 

00:39:06.730 --> 00:39:16.110
e Sparking stars envelop the two of us. e 

00:39:16.750 --> 00:39:20.940
e Our white shoulders and white breath... e 

00:39:19.180 --> 00:39:20.950
The day is about to end...

00:39:20.940 --> 00:39:25.620
e I feel it with you. e 

00:39:21.400 --> 00:39:21.980
But...

00:39:22.810 --> 00:39:25.270
But... Today is Christmas Eve.

00:39:25.620 --> 00:39:27.690
e This winter wish. e 

00:39:27.710 --> 00:39:29.520
Perhaps a miracle will happen.

00:39:40.380 --> 00:39:41.870
Kitsune-san! Let's get off here!

00:39:42.700 --> 00:39:44.180
Wh-What the?

00:40:11.670 --> 00:40:15.630
I have with me today a young woman
who's spending this Christmas Eve alone.

00:40:16.140 --> 00:40:18.770
There's nothing wrong with spending
Christmas Eve alone, is there?

00:40:19.100 --> 00:40:21.660
Hey, haven't I seen you
somewhere before?

00:40:22.440 --> 00:40:25.640
Oh, well. Anyway, let's hear it!
Say anything you want!

00:40:25.620 --> 00:40:28.790
Why don't you share with us your feelings
of being lonely on Christmas Eve!

00:40:32.660 --> 00:40:33.470
Keitaro...

00:40:34.720 --> 00:40:38.040
Keitaro, I'm sorry I haven't been
talking to you much lately.

00:40:39.420 --> 00:40:43.970
The thing is, Keitaro, if I let up on you
even a little, you start slacking off.

00:40:45.040 --> 00:40:49.610
So I thought if I wasn't a bit mean to you,
you might fail your exams again this year.

00:40:50.920 --> 00:40:52.040
It was for my own good?

00:40:52.580 --> 00:40:55.460
But in spite of that, you went and
professed your love to me like that...

00:40:55.970 --> 00:40:57.390
I was really surprised.

00:40:58.660 --> 00:40:59.550
Hey, Shinobu!

00:41:03.690 --> 00:41:04.500
Dad!

00:41:05.130 --> 00:41:05.820
Shinobu!

00:41:09.010 --> 00:41:10.240
Dad!

00:41:10.270 --> 00:41:11.060
Shinobu...

00:41:11.820 --> 00:41:12.920
What's going on here?!

00:41:13.990 --> 00:41:14.640
Shinobu!

00:41:15.260 --> 00:41:16.000
What the?

00:41:16.460 --> 00:41:21.470
I went back to my parents' house because
I needed to think things through alone.

00:41:21.950 --> 00:41:25.980
There was no way I could do that
if I was looking at you all the time.

00:41:26.590 --> 00:41:27.850
I remembered all sorts of things.

00:41:28.500 --> 00:41:32.990
Like how you could have kept lying
that time we first met,

00:41:33.610 --> 00:41:36.210
but you went, "It's not good to lie,"
and tried to leave.

00:41:36.930 --> 00:41:39.700
I'd never met anyone
as dumb as you.

00:41:40.220 --> 00:41:41.870
So I locked myself up
in my room...

00:41:42.550 --> 00:41:43.650
And my hair got all messed up...

00:41:44.290 --> 00:41:45.010
And look at this!

00:41:45.780 --> 00:41:48.150
I even got bags under my eyes
from thinking about it all.

00:41:48.720 --> 00:41:50.120
It's all your fault, understand?

00:41:54.860 --> 00:41:55.850
So here goes.

00:41:58.440 --> 00:42:02.860
I profess that I want to be
with you forever, Keitaro.

00:42:03.950 --> 00:42:05.770
I want to go to Tokyo University
together with you.

00:42:15.290 --> 00:42:16.100
Was that good enough?

00:42:46.010 --> 00:42:46.460
Yeah!

00:43:03.270 --> 00:43:04.550
Let's go home. People.

00:43:11.550 --> 00:43:14.480
So... Keitaro got a B rating, did he?

00:43:14.750 --> 00:43:15.920
That's amazing!

00:43:16.190 --> 00:43:17.680
It was blind luck. That's all.

00:43:18.830 --> 00:43:21.090
What. Aren't you happy, Naru?

00:43:21.450 --> 00:43:22.900
It wouldn't hurt to
compliment him a little.

00:43:24.830 --> 00:43:25.790
Oh. Lay off!

00:43:26.280 --> 00:43:28.970
All I did was say that I wanted
to go to Tokyo U with him.

00:43:29.560 --> 00:43:31.650
W-We're just friends!

00:43:34.830 --> 00:43:37.070
Hey! What's keeping you guys?

00:43:38.540 --> 00:43:41.210
Like I said, Grandma's been
waiting for all of you to...

00:43:42.170 --> 00:43:42.920
I-I'm sorry!

00:43:43.340 --> 00:43:46.240
You'll never change!

00:43:46.810 --> 00:43:49.480
That's so very true!

