Best whishes

00:43:55.640 --> 00:43:59.140
in the 21st

00:43:55.640 --> 00:43:59.140
century!

00:43:59.530 --> 00:44:02.270
Happy new year!

00:44:03.060 --> 00:44:05.400
Please treat me well.

